8
5
-- SHOW CREATE TABLE cannot serialize a multi-shard proxy with an insert-only sharding key
1
-- SHOW CREATE TABLE cannot serialize a reloadable single-shard proxy either
1
-- an unknown cluster is rejected at CREATE (prints 1 if the expected error is raised)
1
-- a wrong number of arguments is rejected (prints 1 if the expected error is raised)
1
-- a database that refers to itself is rejected at CREATE instead of recursing (prints 1 if the expected error is raised)
1
-- a CREATE that would complete a cycle through a Remote database is rejected (prints 1 if the expected error is raised)
